  "question": {
    "text": "Which types of bonds is/are present in diborane (<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></math>)?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Ionic bond",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Three centre bond",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Hydrogen bond",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Co-ordinate bond",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "The diborane molecule has two types of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> bond :<br /><br />(i) <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub></math> -It is a normal covalent bond.<br /><br />(ii) <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> - It is a three centred bond (bridging bond).<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0007_b09b14e541b7.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 170px; height: 98px;\" />"
  }
}